{
    "_comment_status": "Mounted from Docs/Interactions/ActivityProposals/cafe_boardgames.json. Goodwill -> ordinary NPC invitations -> authored shared Trust; not dating. The 25/40 proposal tiers and this 40 threshold are data-tuning suggestions, not an approved progression pace.",
    "_comment_invitations": "SelfRelationships with no relationship-type filter admits existing ordinary acquaintances. selfRelationshipRequirement checks the host -> candidate existing relationship via Peek and fails if absent; it does not create relationships. Goodwill controls eligibility, not inviteChance. Friendliness is existing composite ordering, not pure Goodwill probability. No Friend/Trust/current-awake/mood gate is added.",
    "_comment_outcome": "A one-minute Join does not finish the two-hour booking or a whole game. The guarded scene authors only a short friendly tutorial and fair practice turns, never winner-based Trust. Future custom events may add time/checks; none are invented here. No invitation-acceptance, end-of-visit or fallback reward. Solo/ineligible paths show only neutral text.",
    "_comment_rewards": "Each score uses normal IncreaseRelationship group fanout: distinct directed nonself pairs, no duplicate pairs within a call. Initial attendees -> attendees once per score; arrivals joining -> companions and reverse once per score, without paying existing companion pairs again. Goodwill base 2 (Trust: trustRewardEligible - paid by the job at the launch to those who agreed beforehand and came on time, not by the scene) remains subject to normal API scaling/caps; no group-N multiplier or final stored amount is promised.",
